--------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software CRATEDIG links but does NOT distribute
--------------------------------------------------------------------

FFmpeg (libavformat, libavcodec, libavutil, libswresample)
    https://ffmpeg.org — LGPL-2.1-or-later when built without
    --enable-gpl.

    CRATEDIG links FFmpeg dynamically against the shared libraries
    already present on the user's system, and ships no FFmpeg binary or
    source. Only LGPL-covered demux/decode APIs are used.

    A distributed CRATEDIG binary must be linked against an LGPL build.
    See docs/LICENSING.md; the check is enforced at configure time by
    -DCRATEDIG_REQUIRE_LGPL_FFMPEG=ON.

--------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled audio
--------------------------------------------------------------------

No audio is committed to this repository. The starter pack is fetched
by scripts/fetch_starter_pack.sh and is CC0-1.0 / public domain only,
with per-file provenance and sha256 in
assets/starter-pack/MANIFEST.toml.
